	(text "Power: 24 V -> PTC -> TVS -> SS210 -> pi-filter -> LMR38020 (5V_BUCK)\n-> TPS2116 (VIN2 = USB VBUS) -> 5V_SYS -> Pico VSYS, TPS563201 (3V3_WM, EN = GP15), TLV75533 (3V3_GNSS).\nDesign notes and decisions: ../sketch.md. Cross-sheet nets are global labels."
